{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RopeBot is a third-person puzzle platformer built around realistic rope physics. Use your Rope Arm to shoot, control, and manipulate ropes as you navigate through challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> <br>    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rope Arm:</strong> Shoot ropes from your Rope Arm, adjust their length in real-time, and fire both ends to connect objects together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Swinging:</strong> Ropes have a slight bounce that adds depth to the swinging mechanics, rewarding players who master the timing and momentum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rope Belt:</strong> Connect to multiple objects simultaneously, drag several items at once, or carry objects while keeping your Rope Arm free for swinging and interaction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Interactive Physics Objects:</strong> Manipulate Hinge Platforms, Drawer Platforms, and Pivot Platforms using your ropes to solve environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electric Rope System:</strong> Electrify your ropes by connecting to Electric Generators, then power doors, platforms, and other devices through repeaters and receivers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2478560?t=1757951696","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478560/ce07198c728388a3a7a0d25a049c8fe1c221a518/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757951696","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478560/72e364e4185ce486947600134e8b70f52ca09470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757951696","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478560/72e364e4185ce486947600134e8b70f52ca09470/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757951696","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RopeBot is a third-person puzzle platformer built around realistic rope physics. Use your Rope Arm to shoot, control, and manipulate ropes as you navigate through challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> <br>    </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rope Arm:</strong> Shoot ropes from your Rope Arm, adjust their length in real-time, and fire both ends to connect objects together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Swinging:</strong> Ropes have a slight bounce that adds depth to the swinging mechanics, rewarding players who master the timing and momentum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rope Belt:</strong> Connect to multiple objects simultaneously, drag several items at once, or carry objects while keeping your Rope Arm free for swinging and interaction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Interactive Physics Objects:</strong> Manipulate Hinge Platforms, Drawer Platforms, and Pivot Platforms using your ropes to solve environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electric Rope System:</strong> Electrify your ropes by connecting to Electric Generators, then power doors, platforms, and other devices through repeaters and receivers.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Scott Ewing"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"